PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Objects
    - Three directed graphs: G1, G2, G3
    - Nodes: circles 80px diameter
    - Edges: arrows 4px stroke
  L2: Morphisms
    - Graph homomorphism arrows labeled φ, ψ
  L3: Labels
    - "Category 𝘿𝙞𝙨𝙘𝙧𝙚𝙩𝙚"
    - "Objects: Directed Graphs / Automata"
    - "Morphisms: Graph Homomorphisms"
  L4: Annotation Overlay
    - Highlight: φ(v) = v', φ(e) = e'

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
